<div style="min-height:100%;background:var(--color-bg);color:var(--color-text);font-family:var(--font-body);padding:0 20px 64px;">
  <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
    <Layouts.site_nav />

    <div style="padding:36px 0 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-chakra);margin-bottom:10px;">
        ninja tool pouch
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,40px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--color-neutral-100);">
        Uses
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-neutral-400);margin:0;max-width:52ch;">
        What's actually in the pouch, not what's aspirational. Updated when something changes, not on a schedule.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:32px 0;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;">
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">editor</span>
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">Neovim</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">terminal</span>
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">WezTerm / Ghostty</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">shell</span>
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">fish / Nushell</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-neutral-800);">
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">os</span>
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">NixOS (I use NixOS BTW)</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:12px 0;">
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-600);white-space:nowrap;">ai pair</span>
        <span style="color:var(--color-neutral-200);">Claude Code CLI</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <Layouts.site_footer />
  </div>
</div>
